1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:06,530
Before you run a strategy for real, test it on past prices.

2
00:00:06,630 --> 00:00:11,820
Open the Tester.

3
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:15,630
Pick one of your strategies, here a Darvas Box added from the Marketplace.

4
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:23,070
Its settings appear. You can change any of them before the test.

5
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:26,210
Choose the instrument to test it on.

6
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:30,570
Set the time period and timeframe to look back over.

7
00:00:30,670 --> 00:01:06,230
Press Start. It replays the past prices and trades them for you.

8
00:01:06,330 --> 00:01:11,290
The results: profit or loss, win rate, drawdown and number of trades.

9
00:01:11,390 --> 00:01:16,360
The chart marks every buy and sell the strategy made.

10
00:01:16,460 --> 00:01:20,360
On the right, the full breakdown. No real money is used.

